  "description": "A fully managed, cross-platform cryptography library for .NET 10 - featuring: ASN.1 encoding, a broad set of symmetric and asymmetric ciphers, digests, MACs, signatures and key agreement, post-quantum algorithms (ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA, LMS and more), TLS and DTLS, OpenPGP, CMS, PKCS, CMP, CRMF, OCSP, TSP, X.509 certificate and CRL handling, and OpenSSL PEM support.",
